	 Lamar St.\, Suite 2000. NRF workspace consists of eight (8) practice floo
	rs (lvl’s 18\, 20 thru 26) including two (2) reception/meeting room floors
	 and a two-floor interconnecting staircase as designed by Rottet Studio an
	d completed June 7th\, 2024.\n\nhttps://architecturehouston.org/event/hxd-
