DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you
	 purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Ti
	ckets (Ticketmaster) \nResale Tickets (VividSeats) \nNate Bargatze: Big Du
	mb Eyes World Tour LIVE at UBS Arena\nNate Bargatze brings his hilarious B
	ig Dumb Eyes World Tour to UBS Arena in Belmont Park\, NY. Known for his u
	nique comedic style and engaging storytelling\, Nate delivers an unforgett
	able night of stand-up comedy that will have audiences laughing throughout
