IMAGE;VALUE=URI;DISPLAY=BADGE;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://365thingsinhouston
 .com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Keith-Karnaky-Jazz-Group-at-Archway-Galler
 y.jpg
